sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant N2 as nginx :11438 (TLS)
    participant WS as webui.sock
    participant W as Open WebUI :8080
    participant N1 as nginx :11437 (TLS)
    participant LL as litellm :4000
    participant RC as bundled Redis cache
    participant L as llama-server router<br/>(child model)

    B->>N2: https://localhost:11438 (UI + SSE)
    N2->>WS: proxy to unix socket
    WS->>W: TCP :8080
    W->>N1: OPENAI_API_BASE_URL https://host.docker.internal:11437/v1<br/>Bearer LITELLM_WEBUI_KEY
    N1->>LL: proxy via litellm.sock
    LL->>LL: auth + limits for the WebUI's own key
    LL->>RC: look up exact request
    alt cache hit
        RC-->>LL: cached response
    else cache miss
        LL->>L: pinned router for that model, TCP :8080
        L-->>LL: SSE / JSON
        LL->>RC: store response with 1h TTL
    end
    LL-->>W: stream
    W-->>B: stream (buffering off)
